<div
  style="background:#17633d;padding:20px 0;text-align:center;color:#fff;font-weight:bold;"
>
  Thanks! Your Reservation is confirmed at
  {{hotelName}}
</div>
<div style="background:#fff;padding:32px 32px 24px 32px;">
  <p>Your booking with
    <b>{{hotelName}}</b>
    is unconfirmed and not guaranteed.<br />
    Please make payment of
    <b>₦{{bookingAmount}}</b>
    to immediately confirm your booking and room reservation. Unconfirmed
    booking may be cancelled at any time by the hotel.<br />
    If you wish to make payment arrangement, please reach the hotel.<br />
    Your bookings is as below:</p>
  <div style="margin:24px 0;">
    <div>Room Reservation: {{numberOfRooms}} {{roomCategory}}</div>
    <div>Check-in: {{checkIn}}</div>
    <div>Check-out: {{checkOut}}</div>
    <div>Booking number: {{bookingReference}}</div>
    <div>Booked By: {{bookedBy}}</div>
    <div>Total Rooms Booked: {{totalRooms}}</div>
  </div>
  <p>The hotel reserves the right to change your selected room to a room in same
    or higher category for your comfort in the rare case of your selected room
    being unavailable.<br />
    <b>9jahotel.</b></p>
</div>